<Docs title="Getting started"><h1>Getting started</h1><p>EDL currently builds from the repository's Nim bootstrap substrate. Clone the project, build the substrate, then build the EDL compiler.</p><pre><code>git clone https://github.com/skygenesisenterprise/edl-lang
cd edl-lang
./build_all.sh
edl/scripts/build.sh
build/edl/edlc run edl/examples/hello.edl</code></pre><h2>Useful commands</h2><pre><code>build/edl/edlc check edl/examples/hello.edl
build/edl/edlc build edl/examples/hello.edl -o hello
build/edl/edlc emit-nim edl/examples/hello.edl</code></pre><div class="callout"><strong>Honest status:</strong> <code>edl init</code>, formatting, tests as a user-facing command, package management, and documentation generation are part of the toolchain contract but are not implemented yet.</div></Docs>
